  "id": "environmental-noise",
  "term": "environmental noise",
  "definition": "Environmental noise is noise present in the surrounding environment; infrasonic noise is one type of it. In the source material, this kind of noise is described as having harmful effects on the body and as being able to impair learning, memory, and other cognitive functions.",
